From: RDNA3-Hackintosh
Subject: [PATCH] radv: always create the PS epilog cache

radv_CreateDevice makes device->ps_epilogs only when a feature that needs
PS epilogs is enabled (graphicsPipelineLibrary, shaderObject,
extendedDynamicState, some extendedDynamicState3 bits). A Vulkan 1.3
application can still make depth/stencil test state dynamic (core
since 1.3) without enabling extendedDynamicState; a pipeline whose
fragment shader writes depth then sets depth_output_needs_epilog, and the
first draw looks the epilog up in a cache that was never initialised
(card run 56: Chess crashed in radv_shader_part_cache_get from
radv_bind_ps_epilog during glReadPixels' blit on the Metal plugin).
---
diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_device.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_device.c
index c01cbff..5fe7d86 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_device.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_device.c
@@ -1695,14 +1695,10 @@ radv_CreateDevice(VkPhysicalDevice physicalDevice, const VkDeviceCreateInfo *pCr
          goto fail;
    }
 
-   if (device->vk.enabled_features.graphicsPipelineLibrary || device->vk.enabled_features.shaderObject ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState3ColorBlendEnable ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState3ColorWriteMask ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState3AlphaToCoverageEnable ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState3ColorBlendEquation ||
-       device->vk.enabled_features.extendedDynamicState3RasterizationSamples)
-      radv_shader_part_cache_init(&device->ps_epilogs, &ps_epilog_ops);
+   /* Always: a Vulkan 1.3 application may make depth/stencil test state dynamic (core) without enabling
+    * extendedDynamicState, and a depth-writing fragment shader then needs a PS epilog. The cache is only
+    * a hash set, so making it unconditionally costs nothing when no epilog is ever looked up. */
+   radv_shader_part_cache_init(&device->ps_epilogs, &ps_epilog_ops);
 
    if (pdev->info.has_zero_index_buffer_bug || device->compiler_info.key.mitigate_smem_oob) {
       result = radv_bo_create(
